      "revision": 1368771605,
      "text": "Chrysalidocarpus tsaratananensis is a species of flowering plant in the family Arecaceae. It is a palm found only in Madagascar. It is native to the Tsaratanana Massif of northern Madagascar, where it grows in montane moist forest and montane moist shrubland on steep slopes from 1,400 to 1,900 metres elevation."
